  "notes": [
    "The published sdist pyproject changes only the Cython build requirement from the tag version Cython>=3.2.4 to Cython>=3.2.9,<3.3; native library settings match the tag. Both file hashes are recorded.",
    "The retained official lxml sdist already includes the exact patch and patch applier; libxslt pristine archive alone is not its wheel source cohort.",
    "The released pyproject explicitly selects libxslt 1.1.43 with backports for Linux and 1.1.45 for Windows. The inspected upstream sources do not state an additional rationale; this is not a BashKitten version downgrade.",
    "LIBRARY_PATCHES declares only the libxslt patch. The selected libxml2 2.14.6, libiconv 1.18 and zlib 1.3.2 archives are unpatched by this recipe.",
    "All six selected Linux wheels match pinned PyPI hashes and contain the backport markers; amd64 Python 3.14 exports zlibVersion=1.3.2, _libiconv_version=0x0112 and xsltCleanupSourceDoc.",
    "Newer independent libxslt/libiconv releases are not represented as incorporated in these upstream-produced lxml wheels."
  ]
